  "display_title": "How I Ended Up Seducing My Childhood Friend",
  "description": "*“Ellion, we’re close friends, right…?”*\n\nRosaline never actually wanted to go to the monastery, but after a careless childhood promise, she’s stuck with no way out. In desperation, she turns to her childhood friend, Ellion, to vent her frustrations. As they brainstorm ways to escape her fate, she reaches a bold conclusion: she must break the vow of chastity that the monastery prizes so dearly. The only question is, who should be her partner in crime? Just then, her eyes land on the perfect candidate sitting right in front of her. \n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Sunjeong Danpyeonseon (순정 단편선) Collection.*",
